sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Applicant (React)
    participant N as Nginx
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant Q as Postgres queue
    participant W as Worker (LangGraph)
    participant LLM as OpenRouter
    participant DB as Postgres (state, events)
    actor A as Analyst (React)

    C->>N: POST /api/v1/onboarding/start
    N->>API: forward (round robin)
    API->>DB: store prospect (encrypted), onboarding=received
    API->>Q: enqueue run(onboarding_id)
    API-->>C: 202 {onboarding_id, events_url}
    C->>API: GET /onboarding/{id}/events (SSE)
    W->>Q: pick job (SKIP LOCKED)
    W->>LLM: supervisor: what next? (pseudonymized)
    LLM-->>W: [identity, risk]
    par parallel agents
        W->>W: identity agent -> verify_identity
    and
        W->>W: risk agent -> check_risk_lists
    end
    W->>DB: checkpoint + events (NOTIFY)
    DB-->>API: NOTIFY
    API-->>C: SSE: identity 0.65 (low), risk low
    W->>LLM: supervisor: next?
    LLM-->>W: remediation
    W->>W: guard OK, remediation plan (RAG citations)
    W->>DB: interrupt, status=awaiting_analyst
    API-->>C: SSE: under review
    A->>API: GET /reviews?status=pending
    A->>API: POST /reviews/{id}/decision {approve, notes}
    API->>Q: enqueue resume(Command(resume=...))
    W->>DB: load checkpoint, continue
    W->>W: documentation -> response -> finalize
    API-->>C: SSE: approved + required documents
